# Only what the image builds from (Dockerfile): never .env files, keys, test reports or local builds.
*
!apps/
!packages/
!deploy/spa-csp.txt
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!tsconfig.json
!release-commits.txt
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Secrets the re-included directories might hold, after the re-includes so they win.
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.p8
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/*.pkpass
**/secrets/
**/*-service-account*.json
